/T (Five rules matched out of forty-six evaluated. Findings include two administrator accounts without the "Account is sensitive and cannot be delegated" flag, a non-empty Schema Admins group, Active Directory Recycle Bin disabled, two administrator accounts not belonging to the Protected Users group, and an Organizational Unit \(OU\) lacking accidental deletion protection.)
/E (Five rules matched out of forty-six evaluated. Findings include two administrator accounts without the "Account is sensitive and cannot be delegated" flag, a non-empty Schema Admins group, Active Directory Recycle Bin disabled, two administrator accounts not belonging to the Protected Users group, and an Organizational Unit \(OU\) lacking accidental deletion protection.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
>>
