4035 0 obj
<<
/Title (Critical analysis for the report: 1.The administrator account password \(sali-adm / salma.ouchahed\) is exposed in clear text within the command line. As a result, it may also be stored in the Bash history, terminal logs, and the screenshot itself. This provides an excellent opportunity to discuss operational security best practices. During real-world penetration tests or red team engagements, passwords should never be supplied directly on the command line. Instead, secure alternatives such as interactive password prompts, protected configuration files, or environment variables should be used.)
/Dest [66 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4037 0 R
/Next 4033 0 R
>>
