<<
/Title (No accounts were found with constrained delegation configured toward the krbtgt account, which is responsible for signing all Kerberos tickets within the domain. Purple Knight explains that such a misconfiguration could allow an attacker to generate service tickets on behalf of any user, enabling an attack similar to a Golden Ticket compromise. No such configuration was identified in the assessed environment.)
/Dest [61 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4061 0 R
/Next 4057 0 R
>>
endobj
